SELECT '编辑距离','## 题目描述

给定两个字符串 `word1` 和 `word2`，每次可以插入、删除或替换一个字符，求将 `word1` 转换成 `word2` 所需的最少操作数。

## ACM 模式输入

输入两行，分别是 `word1` 和 `word2`；字符串可能为空。

## ACM 模式输出

输出最少操作数。

## 核心代码模式

实现 `Solution.minDistance(word1: string, word2: string) -> int`。

## 数据范围

- `0 ≤ |word1|,|word2| ≤ 500`','["困难","字符串","动态规划"]','设 dp[i][j] 为两个前缀的编辑距离。末尾字符相同则继承左上状态，否则在插入、删除、替换三个状态的最小值上加一。时间复杂度 O(nm)。',0,0,'[{"input":"horse\\nros\\n","output":"3\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"intention\\nexecution\\n","output":"5\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"a\\na\\n","output":"0\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"abc\\n\\n","output":"3\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"kitten\\nsitting\\n","output":"3\\n","isHidden":true}]','{"timeLimit":3000,"memoryLimit":262144,"outputLimitBytes":1048576}','{"mode":"function","className":"Solution","methodName":"minDistance","parameters":[{"name":"word1","type":"string"},{"name":"word2","type":"string"}],"returnType":"int","resultSource":"return","comparator":{"type":"EXACT"},"harnessVersion":1,"judgeCases":[{"input":"{\\"word1\\":\\"horse\\",\\"word2\\":\\"ros\\"}","output":"3","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"word1\\":\\"intention\\",\\"word2\\":\\"execution\\"}","output":"5","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"word1\\":\\"a\\",\\"word2\\":\\"a\\"}","output":"0","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"word1\\":\\"abc\\",\\"word2\\":\\"\\"}","output":"3","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"word1\\":\\"kitten\\",\\"word2\\":\\"sitting\\"}","output":"3","isHidden":true}]}',1,1,0,0,@admin_id,0,0,21 FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM question_public_number WHERE problemNo=21);
