SELECT '最小覆盖子串','## 题目描述

给定字符串 `s` 和 `t`，返回 `s` 中包含 `t` 全部字符（包括重复字符）的最短子串。测试数据保证存在唯一答案。

## ACM 模式输入

输入两行，分别是 `s` 和 `t`。

## ACM 模式输出

输出最小覆盖子串。

## 核心代码模式

实现 `Solution.minWindow(s: string, t: string) -> string`。

## 数据范围

- `1 ≤ |t| ≤ |s| ≤ 10^5`','["困难","字符串","哈希表","滑动窗口"]','用计数表记录窗口仍缺少的字符。右指针扩张直到覆盖 t，再移动左指针压缩并更新最短答案。时间复杂度 O(|s|+|t|)。',0,0,'[{"input":"ADOBECODEBANC\\nABC\\n","output":"BANC\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"a\\na\\n","output":"a\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"aa\\naa\\n","output":"aa\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"aa\\na\\n","output":"a\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"cabwefgewcwaefgcf\\ncae\\n","output":"cwae\\n","isHidden":true}]','{"timeLimit":3000,"memoryLimit":262144,"outputLimitBytes":1048576}','{"mode":"function","className":"Solution","methodName":"minWindow","parameters":[{"name":"s","type":"string"},{"name":"t","type":"string"}],"returnType":"string","resultSource":"return","comparator":{"type":"EXACT"},"harnessVersion":1,"judgeCases":[{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"ADOBECODEBANC\\",\\"t\\":\\"ABC\\"}","output":"\\"BANC\\"","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"a\\",\\"t\\":\\"a\\"}","output":"\\"a\\"","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"aa\\",\\"t\\":\\"aa\\"}","output":"\\"aa\\"","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"aa\\",\\"t\\":\\"a\\"}","output":"\\"a\\"","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"cabwefgewcwaefgcf\\",\\"t\\":\\"cae\\"}","output":"\\"cwae\\"","isHidden":true}]}',1,1,0,0,@admin_id,0,0,22 FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM question_public_number WHERE problemNo=22);
