SELECT '正则表达式匹配','## 题目描述

实现支持 `.` 和 `*` 的正则表达式匹配：`.` 匹配任意单个字符，`*` 匹配前一个元素零次或多次。匹配必须覆盖整个字符串。

## ACM 模式输入

输入两行，分别为字符串 `s` 和模式 `p`。

## ACM 模式输出

匹配成功输出 `true`，否则输出 `false`。

## 核心代码模式

实现 `Solution.isMatch(s: string, p: string) -> boolean`。

## 数据范围

- `1 ≤ |s| ≤ 20`
- `1 ≤ |p| ≤ 30`
- `*` 前保证存在有效字符','["困难","字符串","动态规划","递归"]','使用记忆化搜索或二维动态规划。遇到下一个字符为星号时，可以跳过该模式元素，或在当前字符匹配时继续使用它。时间复杂度 O(|s||p|)。',0,0,'[{"input":"aa\\na\\n","output":"false\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"aa\\na*\\n","output":"true\\n","isHidden":false},{"input":"ab\\n.*\\n","output":"true\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"aab\\nc*a*b\\n","output":"true\\n","isHidden":true},{"input":"mississippi\\nmis*is*p*.\\n","output":"false\\n","isHidden":true}]','{"timeLimit":3000,"memoryLimit":262144,"outputLimitBytes":1048576}','{"mode":"function","className":"Solution","methodName":"isMatch","parameters":[{"name":"s","type":"string"},{"name":"p","type":"string"}],"returnType":"boolean","resultSource":"return","comparator":{"type":"EXACT"},"harnessVersion":1,"judgeCases":[{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"aa\\",\\"p\\":\\"a\\"}","output":"false","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"aa\\",\\"p\\":\\"a*\\"}","output":"true","isHidden":false},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"ab\\",\\"p\\":\\".*\\"}","output":"true","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"aab\\",\\"p\\":\\"c*a*b\\"}","output":"true","isHidden":true},{"input":"{\\"s\\":\\"mississippi\\",\\"p\\":\\"mis*is*p*.\\"}","output":"false","isHidden":true}]}',1,1,0,0,@admin_id,0,0,23 FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM question_public_number WHERE problemNo=23);
